[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0138","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0138","title":"Palo Alto Networks Prisma Cloud Compute Edition Web界面会话过期不足漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks Prisma Cloud Compute Edition的Web界面存在会话过期不足漏洞（CWE-613）。当管理员删除用户后，该用户的Web会话不会立即失效，已删除用户仍可利用原有会话令牌继续访问系统，导致未授权访问。攻击者需具有低权限账号并诱导用户交互，攻击复杂度低，影响数据完整性。该漏洞不影响Prisma Cloud Enterprise Edition中的Compute组件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0138"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-05-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-06-23T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到Prisma Cloud Compute Edition 34.01.129或更高版本。该版本已修复会话过期问题，删除用户后其会话将立即失效。无变通方案或缓解措施可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T10:16:28Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2025-0138"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0723","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0723.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21264","title":"Microsoft Visual Studio Code 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Visual Studio Code 存在安全功能绕过漏洞（CWE-552），由于对文件或目录的访问控制不当，导致外部方可访问本应受保护的文件。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞，在无需特权的情况下通过诱导用户执行特定操作，绕过 VS Code 的安全机制，从而越权读取敏感文件内容（机密性影响为高），并可能对部分文件进行篡改（完整性影响为低）。该漏洞影响 Visual Studio Code 多个版本，攻击复杂度低，需用户交互配合。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21264"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-13T17:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Visual Studio Code 升级至 1.100.1 或更高版本，并将 Copilot Chat 扩展升级至 0.27.2 或更高版本。可在 VS Code 菜单栏选择\"帮助\"→\"检查更新\"自动安装，或从 code.visualstudio.com 下载最新版覆盖安装。临时缓解措施：限制本地非授权用户对 VS Code 工作区目录的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21264","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2025/CVE-2025-21264.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-21264/README.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2025/CVE-2025-21264.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0723.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0026","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-47423","title":"Personal Weather Station Dashboard 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Personal Weather Station Dashboard 12_lts 版本存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /others/_test.php 发送特制的 test 参数（如 ../../../apache/conf/ssl.key/server.key）实现目录遍历，从而读取服务器任意文件，包括以明文方式泄露服务端 SSL 私钥等敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-47423"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-05-07T18:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:28:06Z","remediation":"升级 PWS Dashboard 至 12_lts 之后的安全版本；如无补丁，立即删除或禁用 `/others/_test.php` 文件；在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面添加规则，拦截包含 `../` 的 `test` 参数请求；限制 Web 进程对敏感目录（如 `/etc`、SSL 密钥目录）的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/haluka92/CVE-2025-47423","https://pwsdashboard.com/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-47423.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-47423-Haluka92_CVE-2025-47423.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-47423/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-47423.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2025-47423.yaml","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/333a12945888842887b9d7f35a124feef86df7c3/docs/2025/pws_pws-dashboard-%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-47423.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/57b2f46f8b4a48cfba3cb8b60306b43a8ab2b242/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47423.json","https://github.com/Haluka92/CVE-2025-47423","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-47423"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0612","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-4318","title":"AWS Amplify Studio 输入验证缺陷导致任意代码执行漏洞","description":"AWS Amplify Studio 的 amplify-codegen-ui 包在表达式绑定处理组件架构属性时缺乏输入验证，导致经认证的用户可通过创建或修改组件，在组件渲染和构建过程中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响 2.20.2 及更早版本，攻击者需具备组件创建或修改权限，利用方式为注入恶意表达式实现远程代码执行。CVSS 评分 9.0（严重），建议升级至 2.20.4 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-4318","GHSA-hf3j-86p7-mfw8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-05-05T19:15:57Z","updated":"2026-07-29T16:17:47Z","remediation":"升级 amplify-codegen-ui 包到 2.20.4 或更高版本（执行 npm install @aws-amplify/codegen-ui@latest 或 yarn upgrade @aws-amplify/codegen-ui），并确保所有分叉或衍生代码均已应用修复补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/AWS-2025-010/","https://github.com/aws-amplify/amplify-codegen-ui/releases/tag/v2.20.3","https://github.com/aws-amplify/amplify-codegen-ui/security/advisories/GHSA-hf3j-86p7-mfw8","https://blog.securelayer7.net/cve-2025-4318-aws-amplify-rce/","https://github.com/aws-amplify/amplify-codegen-ui/commit/ca98c38b7c3d69ae7c94d2f62b51e32e8165dae6","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-4318.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2025/4xxx/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/4xxx/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-43187.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-43186.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-4318.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-43xx/CVE-2025-4318.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0006","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-46719","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI 是一个自托管的人工智能平台，在 0.6.6 版本之前存在存储型跨站脚本漏洞。攻击者可在聊天消息中插入未转义的 HTML 标签和恶意 JavaScript 代码，当其他用户打开包含恶意代码的聊天记录时，脚本会在受害者浏览器中执行，窃取访问令牌从而完全控制受害者账户。若受害者是管理员，攻击者可进一步创建恶意 Python 函数实现服务器端远程代码执行。此外，该漏洞可通过社区共享功能实现跨用户传播，危害范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-46719","GHSA-9f4f-jv96-8766"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-05-05T19:15:57Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:26:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.6.6 或以上版本，该版本已对 HTML 标签进行正确转义以防御 XSS。如无法立即升级，建议在管理面板中关闭「Enable Community Sharing」功能，并禁止用户分享聊天记录以降低攻击面。临时缓解措施还可配置 WAF 规则过滤聊天消息中的恶意 HTML/JavaScript 载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/main/src/lib/components/chat/Messages/Markdown/MarkdownTokens.svelte#L269-L279","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/6fd082d55ffaf6eb226efdeebc7155e3693d2d01","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-9f4f-jv96-8766","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2025/CVE-2025-46719.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/e00b340019f3b31282b4417e15c49f027f0909d3/data/vuln/openwebui/CVE-2025-46719.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/928db9679b69032a137f1c2f3374c28367145ef0/cves/2025/46xxx/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/c78813392a686be9ed8245543249abb80331d014/pypi/open-webui/CVE-2025-46719.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/90bd0a835ff7ed8cfea0a199ea9e2f05e33d6c81/2025/46xxx/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/b705b33e466c706c1129370e07ab2e4166c35b4c/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-46719.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3d0187a2ae2380c20a24da45e4f13e8bdd980484/vulns/open-webui/PYSEC-2026-2716.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6ced4f7862026f4207c9708deb4edf129c83fc5/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-46719.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f6129ff19f955337f9f194ea8d5a3937dce9acb8/content/recipes/cve/cve-2025-46719-open-webui-vulnerable-to-stored-xss-via-unescaped-markdown-token-in-markdowntokens-svelte-leading-to-full-acco.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/be80f241080dc6ff384600eeed4a5579a42f2524/api/intel/products/cve-2025-46719-pip-open-webui.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0005","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-46571","title":"Open WebUI 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Open WebUI（自托管AI平台）存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞，CWE-79分类。低权限用户可通过`/api/v1/files/`接口上传包含恶意JavaScript代码的HTML文件，服务器返回文件ID后，攻击者可构造链接诱导管理员点击，从而劫持管理员账户，进而利用管理员权限通过平台功能实现远程代码执行。默认配置下低权限用户上传的文件仅管理员或上传者自身可查看，限制了攻击面但未消除风险。该漏洞影响0.6.6之前版本，CVSS评分5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-46571","GHSA-8gh5-qqh8-hq3x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-05-05T19:15:57Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:26:38Z","remediation":"升级 Open WebUI 至 v0.6.6 及以上版本（官方已修复文件上传 XSS 漏洞）。如暂无法升级，可在反向代理层限制 `/api/v1/files/` 端点的上传文件类型，禁止上传 `.html` 后缀文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/main/backend/open_webui/routers/files.py#L434-L438","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/commit/ef2aeb7c0eb976bac759e59ac359c94a5b8dc7e0","https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-8gh5-qqh8-hq3x"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0336","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-4293","title":"MRCMS 3.1.3 后台管理组编辑页面存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MRCMS 3.1.3 版本的后台管理组编辑接口 /admin/group/edit.do 存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。具有管理员权限的攻击者可在组名称等字段中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他管理员访问管理组页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息泄露、页面内容篡改或恶意软件传播。攻击者需具备后台登录权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-4293","HWPOC-2025-05ca7d16"],"sources":["cve","github"],"published":"2025-05-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"厂商尚未发布官方补丁。建议升级至 MRCMS 最新版本，对用户输入进行严格的 HTML 实体编码和过滤，实施内容安全策略（CSP）限制脚本执行，并限制后台管理组页面的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bdkuzma/vuln/issues/2","https://vuldb.com/?id.307400","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-4293"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/bdkuzma/vuln/issues/2"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0336.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0072","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0072","title":"Arm Valhall/5th Gen GPU 内核驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Arm Ltd Valhall GPU Kernel Driver 及 Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。本地低权限用户进程通过不当 GPU 内存处理操作访问已释放内存，可导致敏感信息泄露和权限提升，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0072"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-05-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 Valhall GPU Kernel Driver 升级至 r49p4（r29p0-r49p3 分支）或 r54p0（r50p0-r53p0 分支）；将 Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver 升级至 r49p4（r41p0-r49p3 分支）或 r54p0（r50p0-r53p0 分支）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T13:06:00Z","references":["https://developer.arm.com/documentation/110465/latest/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0876","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0876.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21416","title":"Microsoft Azure Virtual Desktop 权限提升漏洞","description":"Azure 虚拟桌面（Azure Virtual Desktop）存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862），已获得低权限身份认证的攻击者可通过网络向目标服务发送特制请求，利用授权检查缺失的缺陷绕过权限控制，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Azure Virtual Desktop 服务，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。攻击复杂度较高（需低权限账号且依赖特定网络条件），但成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受到严重影响。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21416"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-30T18:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:18Z","remediation":"此漏洞已在 Azure 虚拟桌面服务端由 Microsoft 完成修复，用户无需执行任何操作。Azure 虚拟桌面为独占托管服务（Exclusively Hosted Service），微软已在服务端侧部署授权校验修复，所有用户自动受益。无需升级客户端版本或修改配置。如需进一步了解云服务 CVE 透明度策略，请参阅 https://aka.ms/MSRC-Cloud-CVEs。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21416","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21416.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2025/CVE-2025-21416.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-214xx/CVE-2025-21416.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21416.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0876.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0012","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2070","title":"联想 FileZ 客户端不当XML解析任意文件读取漏洞","description":"联想 FileZ（联想网盘）客户端存在 XML 外部实体（XXE）解析不当漏洞（CWE-611）。本地低权限用户若访问攻击者构造的恶意 URL，客户端在解析相关 XML 时可能被诱导读取系统任意文件，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击需本地条件并依赖用户交互（访问特制链接），不影响完整性与可用性。受影响版本为 FileZ Client 11.0.0.10 之前，CVSS 约 5.0–5.1（中危）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2070"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14Z","remediation":"立即将联想网盘 FileZ 客户端升级至 11.0.0.10 或更高版本以修复不当 XML 解析（XXE）问题。升级前请从官方渠道下载安装包并关闭正在运行的 FileZ 客户端。若暂时无法升级，应避免打开未知或不可信链接，限制低权限本地用户访问 FileZ，并在企业环境中通过应用管控禁止运行受影响旧版本客户端作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.filez.com/securityPolicy/2.html?1744703100","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/431324351d69005e5e9ea9d116dc965ce92ed482/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-20701.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/2025/CVE-2025-20700.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-2025-2070.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3_%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3%E7%BD%91%E7%9B%98filez-cve-2025-2070-%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96.toml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-2070.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2070.json","https://github.com/auracast-research/race-toolkit/blob/eec737d3cef3f6155c513c05eddadb07ee8e9197/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/04/GHSA-58xr-825m-v3pq/GHSA-58xr-825m-v3pq.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2070"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0011","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2069","title":"联想 FileZ 客户端 跨站脚本代码执行漏洞","description":"联想网盘FileZ客户端存在跨站脚本漏洞。该漏洞源于应用程序未对用户访问的链接进行充分的安全验证与内容过滤，攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的特制URL。当本地用户访问该恶意链接时，恶意代码将在客户端上下文中执行，可能导致用户数据泄露或远程代码执行。漏洞利用需用户主动点击攻击者提供的链接，成功利用后可进一步获取系统权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2069"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14Z","remediation":"立即将联想 FileZ 客户端升级至联想官方发布的修复版本（请通过 FileZ 客户端内置更新或联想官网下载最新版）。在无法立即升级时，应避免点击来源不明的链接，并在企业网络出口处启用 Web 过滤与 XSS 防护策略作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.filez.com/securityPolicy/2.html?1744703100","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-2069.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3_%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3%E7%BD%91%E7%9B%98filez-cve-2025-2069-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2069.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-2069.html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-20697.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-2025-20690.json","https://github.com/youngrichu/frp-freedom/blob/9eae82725ec6cc64950e34e505e7a03b39bbc4f9/FRP%20Bypass%20Methods%20research.md","https://github.com/mengyuqiao/LLM-Cyberteam/blob/acc4763d4f71f272105dcd08ef139cbc385a4976/crawl/extracted_cve_ids.txt","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-2069"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0010","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2068","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":11095,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":11115}}","description":"联想网盘 FileZ 客户端存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。该漏洞源于客户端对外部传入的 URL 校验不严格，未能正确验证重定向目标的合法性。当本地用户在终端上访问攻击者精心构造的恶意链接时，客户端会将其重定向至攻击者控制的外部站点，进而可能诱导用户泄露会话凭证、身份令牌或其他敏感信息。攻击需目标系统本地用户主动点击或访问特制 URL 方可触发，利用门槛较低但需用户交互。该漏洞影响使用存在缺陷版本 FileZ 客户端的联想网盘用户，CVSS 评分为 5.1，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2068"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-25T16:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:14Z","remediation":"建议立即将联想 FileZ 客户端升级至联想官方发布的最新安全版本（参考 Lenovo 安全公告 Lenovo Security Advisory），并在升级前避免点击来历不明的链接、仅通过官方或可信域名访问网盘。企业管理员可在网络出口防火墙/代理层对 FileZ 相关域名的重定向目标做白名单校验，禁止跳转到非可信第三方域名，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed",