3:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Redis 至 7.4.3 或更高版本以修复漏洞。如暂无法升级，应在防火墙、iptables 或安全组中限制 Redis 端口（默认 6379）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或启用 TLS 并要求客户端证书认证，以阻止未授权连接导致的拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/7.4.3","https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-r67f-p999-2gff","https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey/releases/tag/8.1.1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00014.html","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21605-detection-script-memory-exhaustion-vulnerability-in-redis-database","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21605-mitigation-script-memory-exhaustion-vulnerability-in-redis-database","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21605.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21605.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21605.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21605.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/96c1e5030cd59d2e06d8a9c9959ff981a1b632c6/doc/2025-04/【漏洞预警】Redis 输出缓冲区无限增长漏洞(CVE-2025-21605).md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21605.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21605.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/96c1e5030cd59d2e06d8a9c9959ff981a1b632c6/doc/2025-04/尽快更新Redis，最新漏洞可导致服务器遭受拒绝服务攻击（CVE-2025-21605）.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21605.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21605.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0892.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0055","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-32433","title":"Erlang/OTP SSH 预认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Erlang/OTP SSH 实现中存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-306），由于 SSH 协议消息处理存在缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 SSH 服务器发送特制的协议消息触发该漏洞，在无需有效凭据的情况下绕过认证并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OTP-27.3.3、OTP-26.2.5.11 及 OTP-25.3.2.20 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户立即升级至修复版本或通过防火墙限制 SSH 访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-32433"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-04-16T22:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:11:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Erlang/OTP 至安全版本：OTP-27.3.3、OTP-26.2.5.11 或 OTP-25.3.2.20。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络层面禁用 SSH 服务对外暴露，仅允许受信 IP 访问 22 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/0fcd9c56524b28615e8ece65fc0c3f66ef6e4c12","https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/6eef04130afc8b0ccb63c9a0d8650209cf54892f","https://github.com/erlang/otp/commit/b1924d37fd83c070055beb115d5d6a6a9490b891","https://github.com/erlang/otp/security/advisories/GHSA-37cp-fgq5-7wc2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/16/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/18/6","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/19/1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/04/msg00028.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250425-0001/","https://github.com/ProDefense/CVE-2025-32433/blob/main/CVE-2025-32433.py","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-erlang-otp-ssh-xyZZy","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-32433","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2025/CVE-2025-32433.yaml","https://github.com/ODST-Forge/CVE-2025-32433_PoC","https://github.com/ProDefense/CVE-2025-32433","https://github.com/omer-efe-curkus/CVE-2025-32433-Erlang-OTP-SSH-RCE-PoC","https://github.com/NiteeshPujari/CVE-2025-32433-PoC","https://github.com/TeneBrae93/CVE-2025-3243","https://github.com/0xPThree/cve-2025-32433","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-32433"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0891","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0891.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21585","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2025-21585是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21585"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-15T21:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:47Z","remediation":"tags), I just need to provide the Chinese text.\n\nLet me also verify the length: \"建议立即升级 MySQL Server 到已修复版本：8.0.42、8.4.5 或 9.2.1 及更高版本。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux、Rocky Linux 或 AlmaLinux 系统，请安装对应安全更新（如 RHSA-2025:15699、RLSA-2025:16861、ALSA-2025:16046）。如无法立即升级，可临时通过防火墙限制对 3306 端口的访问，仅允许可信网络连接，并审查数据库账号权限，移除不必要的最高权限账号。\"\n\nThis is well over 20 characters and is in Chinese.\n\nWait, I want to double-check one thing. The task says \"如果 presearch 数据中有补丁链接或修复版本信息，请引用。\" I should cite the Oracle CPU link if possible.\n\nLet me revise:\n\n\"建议立即应用 Oracle 2025 年 4 月关键补丁更新（https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html），升级 MySQL Server 到已修复版本：8.0.42、8.4.5 或 9.2.1 及更高版本。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux、Rocky Linux 或 AlmaLinux 系统，请安装对应安全更新（如 RHSA-2025:15699、RLSA-2025:16861、ALSA-2025:16046）。如无法立即升级，可临时通过防火墙限制对 3306 端口的访问，仅允许可信网络连接，并审查数据库账号权限，移除不必要的最高权限账号。\"\n\nThis cites the Oracle CPU link and the distribution advisories. It's specific, actionable, and in Chinese.\n\nActually, I want to verify one more thing. Looking at the RHEL advisory, it mentions mysql8.4-8.4.6-2.el10_0. This is for RHEL 10. Does this mean upstream 8.4.6 contains the fix? Or did RHEL rebase to 8.4.6?\n\nIn RHEL's packaging model, they typically backport patches to the same upstream version. So if RHEL 10 ships mysql8.4-8.4.6-2.el10_0, it means they started from upstream 8.4.6 and applied their own patches. The upstream 8.4.6 would have been released by Oracle.\n\nBut wait - was 8.4.6 released before or after the April 2025 CPU? If Oracle released 8.4.6 as part of the CPU, then 8.4.6 contains the fix. If Oracle released 8.4.5 with the fix, and RHEL later rebased to 8.4.6 for other reasons, then 8.4.5 also contains the fix.\n\nWithout knowing the exact release timeline, I think it's safer to say \"8.4.5 或更高版本\" rather than \"8.4.6 或更高版本\". This covers both possibilities.\n\nSimilarly for 8.0.42 and 9.2.1.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The RHEL 10 package is 8.4.6-2.el10_0. The \"-2.el10_0\" part means it's the 2nd RHEL-specific patch on top of upstream 8.4.6. If RHEL had been shipping 8.4.5 before, they would have released a patch for 8.4.5, not rebased to 8.4.6. The fact that they rebased to 8.4.6 suggests that 8.4.6 was the upstream version that included the fix.\n\nBut RHEL sometimes rebases to newer upstream versions even for security updates. So I can't be 100% sure.\n\nI'll stick with 8.4.5 as the minimum fixed version for the 8.4 series, since that's the next version after 8.4.4 (the last affected version).\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully:\n- Affected: 8.4.0-8.4.4\n- Next version: 8.4.5\n\nIf Oracle released 8.4.5 with the fix, then 8.4.5 is the minimum fixed version. If Oracle released 8.4.6 with the fix, then 8.4.5 might still be affected.\n\nBut the NVD says \"Supported versions that are affected are 8.4.0-8.4.4\". This implies that versions outside this range (i.e., 8.4.5+) are NOT affected. So 8.4.5+ is the safe recommendation.\n\nSimilarly:\n- 8.0.0-8.0.41 affected → 8.0.42+ not affected\n- 9.0.0-9.2.0 affected → 9.2.1+ not affected\n\nThis interpretation is consistent with standard CVE version range notation.\n\nOK, I'm confident in my remediation now. Let me provide the final text.<value>建议立即应用 Oracle 2025 年 4 月关键补丁更新（https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html），升级 MySQL Server 到已修复版本：8.0.42、8.4.5 或 9.2.1 及更高版本。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux、Rocky Linux 或 AlmaLinux 系统，请安装对应安全更新（如 RHSA-2025:15699、RLSA-2025:16861、ALSA-2025:16046）。如无法立即升级，可临时通过防火墙限制对 3306 端口的访问，仅允许可信网络连接，并审查数据库账号权限，移除不必要的最高权限账号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2025.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250502-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21585.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2025/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/fe242ff8f9bd06fa5992f95d5f72ac31b4b3a661/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-21585.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21585.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0891.toml"}]